---
description: Sandbox, test, and specimen pages render only in dev
globs: Code/**/pages/**, Code/**/dev/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Auto-attaches when editing pages. Sandbox, test, specimen, and sample pages render only on
the local dev server, never in any build.

- Put them under the single `dev/` folder; nowhere else.
- Keep fictional or placeholder content in components only a dev route renders, never in a
  page file. Real pages never import sample components.
- Never weaken the build guard that fails when a `dev/` page reaches the build output.

Full guidance: `Agents/context/dev-only-pages.md`.
